Model and previews created in 3ds Max 2018 with Vray 3.6
Archives contains: MAX 2018 file with Vray 3.6 materials, mapping and textures MAX 2017 file with Vray 3.4 materials, mapping and textures MAX 2016 file with Vray 3.4 materials, mapping and texturesMAX 2016 file with Corona 1.6 materials, mapping and textures MAX 2016 file with scanline basic materialsMAX 2014 file with scanline basic materials3DS, DWG, FBX and OBJ file conversion
MAX and FBX versions have all separated parts with meaningful names. MAX file includes adjusted pivot points for easy positioning and animation. Environments are not included.
Collection of 7 decorative lighting appliances from the Astro series by MetalLux made of glass curls and polished metal structure:

  - 4 pendant light;

  - 1 ceiling light;

  - 1 floor light;

  - 1 wall light.

Purchasing this collection you save 30$. If purchased individually: 160$

This Collection of 3D models is fit for interior renders, is VR/AR ready, with a PBR workflow, or suitable as game assets.
Package includes: Blender, Stand mixer (4 color variations), Kettle, Salt/Pepper Shakers, Set of Faucets (4), Set of Knives (5), Set of Pans (3), Sink
The collection contains a Zip file, with:

  - 
3 Versions with each model/set, for every file format: Beveled - suitable for subdivision and/or smooth shading, Unbeveled - intended as a background object, unsuitable for subdiv/ smooth shading but with a smaller amount of vertices, Subdivided - subdivided in advance;

  - Tailored textures with multiple resolutions (2K, 4K and even 6k for some assets) for a PBR Metalness workflow, such as DIFFUSE/METALLIC/ROUGHNESS/NORMAL;

  - Both OpenGL and DirectX normal maps;

  - An additional preview scene with a camera, lights, and a background;

  - All models and their versions have UV unwrapping, appropriate pivot/origin points and object parenting (if needed);

Formats: 

  - fbx.

  - obj.

  - dae.

  - blend.

  - Scale: Real World - Metric

  - Geometry: All quads with few appropriate triangles

A full scene, with the gradient background and the fully rigged lamp.

All the movements are controlled by 3 parts:
- Base of the lamp (for general movements);
- Head of the lamp (to change the focus of the lamp);
- Main Controller (the one who controls the main movements of the lamp).

Set of ceramic chandeliers: CrustDesigner, producer: Sergey Makhno ArchitectsLink to the manufacturer's website:https://makhno.shop/product-category/lighting/
Overall dimensions of the model: 1430 x 1390 x 1300sizes of chandeliers (from left to right):

  - h460 x d430

  - h680 x d220

  - h330 x d600

About the model:

  - Shaders under Corona-renderer, V-Ray.

  - cards are made with the help of substance painter, shaders are optimized and have minimal impact on rendering time;

  - Polygonization:     Polys: 57401     Verts: 57416

  - the model is dismantled according to the anti-aliasing groups;

  - the light sources are off;

  - displacement maps are disabled;

  - shot down XForm, Box Trick;

  - the models are normally deployed (the textures do not float or tile), the seams are hidden;

  - System units - mm;

  - grids without excess density, all polygons 4-coal;

  - the name of models and materials is spelled out;

  - in .OBJ and .FBX pivot'y all objects in the center of coordinates;

  - the model in the default layer;

  - Model in the group SMA_Crust consisting of 7 objects.

Composition of the archive:

  - .max 2013 with materials CoronaMtl;

  - .max 2013 with the materials of V-Ray;

  - .FBX;

  - .OBJ;

  - .mat (Corona-renderer);

  - .mat (V-Ray);

  - textures;

  - preview.For Corona render, it is recommended to put a version no lower than 1.5, since the glossiness of materials is configured with PBR

Previews are made with the help of Corona-renderer.

A full scene, with the gradient background and the fully rigged lamp.
All the movements are controlled by 3 parts:
- Base of the lamp (for general movements);
- Head of the lamp (to change the focus of the lamp);
- Main Controller (the one who controls the main movements of the lamp).
Hope you like it, and don't forget to take a look at my other models, some of them may be useful!

Contents: 

  - Dualit 4-Slot NewGen Original Toaster in copper version;

  - Dualit Classic Kettle in copper design;

  - a set of hammered copper utensils: a pan with a lid and a frying pan;

  - sliced ​​bread with a board, bread crumbs and a bread knife.

Additionally: three more color variants of a teapot and a toaster. 
The kettle and toaster are connected to the sockets using renderable splines.The stack with Turbosmooth on the kettle and the toaster is not folded.To turn hammered utensils into ordinary copper you can turn off the normal map in the appropriate materials of steel and copper. 
