This 3d model was created by simulation in Marvelous Designer, modified, cleaned and unwrapped in 3ds Max and exported for all popular formats.
Model formats:

  - max (3ds Max 2020, Scanline);

  - max (3ds Max 2020, V-ray,  procedural fabric material included);

  - fbx (Multi Format);

  - obj (Multi Format);

  - 3ds (Multi Format);

  - mb (Maya 2020);

  - c4d (Cinema 4D R20);

Features:

  - Correctly subdividable geometry;

  - Polygonal quads only;

  - Correct UVW-unwrap;

  - Procedural Fabric V-ray material included (in chef_hat_vray);

  - Exported Fabric textures in 8K resolution (in separate zip-archive);

Important:

  - Renders for preview are made in 3ds Max 2020, V-ray Next;

  - Studio environment is not included;

Have any questions? Let us know.

this model can be used in any of your projects. Feel free to leave your rate, so others may know the quality of the model. Thanks, have a nice day!
File formats:
-.blend, rendered with cycles, as seen in the images;
-.obj, with materials applied and textures;
-.fbx, with material slots apply

